---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/support-pages.css';
---

<Base lang="en" title="About — SanMu Audio" description="SanMu Audio is an independent studio developing audio plug-ins with AI, covering equalization, compression, delay and reverb.">
  <Nav lang="en" current="about" />
  <main class="sm-support-page">
    <header class="sm-support-hero">
      <p class="sm-support-eyebrow">About the studio</p>
      <h1>SanMu Audio</h1>
      <p class="sm-support-subtitle">An independent studio, building audio tools with AI.</p>
      <div class="sm-support-actions">
        <a class="button button-dark" href="/en/#products">Explore plug-ins</a>
        <a class="button button-outline" href="/en/downloads">Installers & Source</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="sm-support-story" aria-labelledby="sm-about-project">
      <h2 id="sm-about-project">Starting with everyday recording and mixing.</h2>
      <div class="sm-support-prose">
        <p>SanMu Audio is made by SanMu, an independent studio. The current range includes EQ6, Comp, Delay and Reverb, covering frequency shaping, dynamics, delay and reverb.</p>
        <p>AI contributes to implementation, interface iteration and documentation. SanMu is responsible for product decisions, listening and testing in real DAWs. Full source code is shared under AGPLv3 alongside official signed installers.</p>
        <p>The plug-ins share a consistent layout and approach to controls. The interfaces shown on this site were captured while the plug-ins were responding to music, so you can see their features before downloading.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sm-support-band" aria-labelledby="sm-about-feedback">
      <div class="sm-support-band-inner sm-support-contact">
        <div>
          <p class="sm-support-eyebrow">Take part</p>
          <h2 id="sm-about-feedback">Your feedback helps shape the next update.</h2>
          <p>Share your experience, report a problem, or suggest an improvement to the documentation or controls. For a bug report, include your operating system, DAW, plug-in version and steps to reproduce it. Audio examples help with sound-related issues.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@sanmuaudio.com">contact@sanmuaudio.com ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="sm-support-contact-note">
          <h3>Read before downloading</h3>
          <p>The download center includes product notes, user manuals and open-source license details. Availability is shown for each platform and release.</p>
          <a class="button button-outline" href="/en/downloads">Open downloads</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer lang="en" />
</Base>
